<tr><td>XT5 driver side to the battery fronts (aPower 2 #2 / #3)</td><td>~42″; the 36″ working space stays clear (bollards only at the ends of the run)</td><td>OK</td></tr>
<tr><td>Xebex treadmill side to aPower 2 #1 / aGate fronts</td><td>~42″ / ~45″</td><td>OK (36″ working space clear)</td></tr>
<tr><td>XT5 to the Airstream</td><td>~67″</td><td>Comfortable</td></tr>
<tr><td>XT5 rear to the treadmill</td><td>~37″</td><td>OK</td></tr>
